      47.85,
      354.13,
      539.79,
      377.2
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested to me under Section 32(1) of the Provincial Council Act, No. 42 of 1987, I, Ariya B, Rekawa,Governor of Uva Province, do hereby notify that the following appointments have been approved by me.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
